      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we keep the callback infos in C++ but make them C++-ey with something like https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/c/dawn/+/198974 so we can do `deviceDesc.uncapturedCallback \u003d [](){stuff}` and not require setters?",
